      "text": "The \"recorder\" module can be used to record and playback audio.\nYou can record from a microphone or you can record any audio signals in Syntona.\n\n(Note that if you want to capture all the audio from Ayntona then use the \"Capture...\" button up top.)\n\nTo Do:\n* Click the \"record\" button on the recorder.\n* Talk into the microphone.\n* Click the \"play\" button and hear your voice played back.\n* Click the three-dot icon in the recorder module header to get the popup menu.\n* Select \"Save to WAV...\" and save your recording on disk, if you want.\n\n\n",
